# NFR: MyApp
## AppliesTo: solution

### Performance
- PERF-1 (latency): <= 200 ms (p95 read latency for GET /api/todos)
- PERF-2 (memory): <= 512 MB (steady-state working set)

### Scalability
- SCAL-1 (rps): >= 100 rps (minimum sustained request rate)
- SCAL-2 (uptime): >= 99.9 % (example documentation site availability)

### Security
- SEC-1: classification: internal
- SEC-2: authz: TodoOwner

### Compliance
- NIS2: the example pipeline links ADRs, requirements and artefacts as evidence
- GDPR: the example stores no personal data
